    The 4-Checkpoint Protocol tells you whether biotechnology fits on paper. The 3 Gates make you test it
    in the real world before you spend 2-6 more years and real money finding out the hard way.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <p class="gates-block__title">
      Do not commit to an MSc, a PhD, or an expensive private biotech college before passing all three gates.
    </p>
    <div class="gates-row">
