  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Do not try to answer "is biotechnology a good career in India" in the abstract for one more month
    based on one more relative’s opinion or one more forum thread.
  </p>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      Run yourself through The 4-Checkpoint Protocol above, honestly, on paper.
    </p>
    <p>
      Then pass The 3 Gates — one real project or certification, one honest two-minute explanation of your
      target lane, and one real conversation with a working professional — before you register for an
      expensive MSc, PhD, or private-college seat.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Achieving earlier financial freedom through biotechnology comes down to building a genuine
    <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong> on top of the degree — a real specialization, regulatory
    or QA expertise, bioinformatics and data fluency, or research depth — not the degree title by itself.
